/// Stores key/value pairs in a ttlru in-memory cache. This cache is therefore reset every
/// time the service restarts.
///
/// The cache ttlru provides a simple, goroutine safe, cache with a fixed number of
/// entries. Each entry has a per-cache defined TTL.
///
