/// [`expirable`](https://github.com/hashicorp/golang-lru/v2/expirable)
///
/// The field init_values can be used to pre-populate the memory cache with any number of
/// key/value pairs:
///
/// ```yaml
/// cache_resources:
///   - label: foocache
///     ttlru:
///       default_ttl: '5m'
///       cap: 1024
///       init_values:
